OpenInference DECISION spans for any decision API, over a fetch seam.

This directory is a fork of the OpenInference TypeSafe instrumentation:

  https://github.com/Arize-ai/openinference
  js/packages/openinference-instrumentation-typesafe/src
  (attributes.ts, instrumentation.ts) at commit
  c364180e5be52f0cdc00fbc88f9462603569f4e2

which is Copyright the OpenInference authors (Arize AI), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Everything in this directory is distributed under
that license; see LICENSE here. The rest of this repository is not.

Changes from upstream:

- attributes.ts reads the request and response as the JSON bodies on the
  wire instead of @typesafe-ai/sdk objects, records non-JSON bodies as text,
  and no longer records the SDK's timeout/retry invocation parameters.
- trace.ts replaces instrumentation.ts. The @typesafe-ai/sdk binding is gone:
  no InstrumentationBase, no require-hook or prototype patching, no APIPromise
  handling, no OITracer trace config, no suppressed-tracing check. A decision
  call is traced by wrapping the fetch it is made with, using a tracer and
  parent context the caller passes in.
- protocols.ts is new: the per-protocol constants (Jev System One, OpenAI
  Decisions).
